              "text": "die Ausfahrt — \"the exit (from a motorway or a garage)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Wir nehmen die nächste Ausfahrt und fahren in die Stadt. We take the next exit and drive into town."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: die Ausfahrten. Ausfahrt freihalten — keep the exit clear, a sign on many garage doors."
            }
          ]
